    "identifier": "festering-siphonage",
    "description": "<p><strong>Skill:</strong> Medicine</p>\n<p><strong>Exploit Type:</strong> Combat Exploit</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Necrotic Hand Subclass</p>\n<p>You are able to siphon off a portion of your target’s strength. When you deal Lethal Attack damage, you may choose to forgo 1 Lethal Attack damage dice. The target must make a Strength Saving throw.</p>\n<p>On a failure, the target reduces its AC and Saving throws by 1, until the end of your next turn. You gain a +2 bonus to your next attack targeting the affected creature, until the end of your next turn.</p>",
